    654  f301							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    655  f301							; TallyEntry — level-bonus tally body (user spec 2026-10-02). Entered from
    656  f301							; bank0's TallyTramp ($FFE6) via jsr; tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) so A (and
    657  f301							; Z) survive back to the bank0 caller.
    658  f301							;   DropTarget == 0 (pickup frame) -> ARM: snapshot the bonus into TallyTicks
    659  f301							;     in 50-pt units — 20 = miner (1000), (BarLevel+3)/6 = remaining time
    660  f301							;     (50% -> 10 ticks -> 500), 1/bomb, 2/life — then arm the 4-frame pace
    661  f301							;     divider (TickCounter), clear jet/beam, set DropTarget = $FE.
    662  f301							;   DropTarget == $FE (every frame) -> STEP: dec TickCounter; on 0 reload 4,
    663  f301							;     dec TallyTicks. Event A: b0 = add 50, b1 = coin tone written here
    664  f301							;     (AUDC/F/V + BombSnd=8; bank0 TallyWork's UpdateBombSound holds it,
    665  f301							;     coin = every 4 ticks = 200 pts), b2 = done (last tick consumed).
    666  f301							; Pinned $F313 (org $F9D9 below: level data pins the overflow = build fails).
    667  f301							; Was $F310 → $F313 (Phase 4 walk-head; kernel TallyEntry EQU moves with
    668  f301							; it — both jmp operands are symbolic). The LWC M1 tip test (2026-10-08)
    669  f301							; funds itself by moving ColOff/ColMask past this pin (see their comment).
    670  f301							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
